<title>BARBADOS: CRICKET-WEST INDIES 298 ALL OUT V INDIA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WEST INDIES 298 ALL OUT V INDIA.</headline>
<dateline>BRIDGETOWN, Barbados 1997-03-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>West Indies were 298 all out in 98.4 overs in the third day of the third test match against India on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scores: West Indies 298 in 98.4 overs (S.Chanderpaul 137 not out) v India.</p>
</text>
